{"availability":"available","full":"DigitalVeer/before","name":"before","description":"Voice agents gather collateral history and turn confirmed witness accounts into traceable timeline evidence. Guided demo and local live workflow.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T22:53:07Z","updated":"2026-10-09T00:24:31Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://before.veersingh.com/demo","topics":["deepgram","medplum","nextjs","voice-agents"],"demo":"https://before.veersingh.com/demo","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.591Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.591Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.591Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:44.036Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.591Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The story before the hospital. A voice agent asks the people who were there. Every claim keeps its source.","Before reconstructs a stroke patient's timeline from witness conversations. The agent separates direct observations from hearsay, asks for a checkable time anchor, reads the full claim back, and waits for an explicit yes. A deterministic validator checks the transcript before the live workflow can write preliminary evidence to Medplum. The clinician reviews it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DigitalVeer/before/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b46ee23d82a385a462e52c95b9e9d619b2e2128d81c38700d49a86b9ba7f6ecb","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:44.129Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.677Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The story before the hospital. A voice agent asks the people who were there. Every claim keeps its source.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DigitalVeer/before/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"No API keys, Docker, microphone, or accounts required for the guide